(165, 'Happy Friday, Team! 🎉\r\n\r\nWe’re excited to officially announce and invite everyone to our Year-End Party 2025! Get ready for a fun, colorful, and unforgettable night as we celebrate the year together. ✨\r\n\r\n📅 When: December 12, 2025\r\n🎡 Theme: Coachella\r\n📍 Where: The Candour, Kabayan Drive, Tabun, Mabalacat, Philippines\r\n🕔 Registration Starts: 5:00 PM\r\n\r\nAnd of course, what’s a YEP without exciting activities? Here’s what to look forward to:\r\n🎁 Raffle Prizes\r\n💃 Best Dressed Awards (Male & Female)\r\n🏆 Dance Contest Winner Announcement\r\n\r\nWe can’t wait to celebrate with all of you! To confirm your attendance, please register using the link & QR code below:\r\n\r\nhttps://tinyurl.com/3zppj7r9\r\n\r\nSee you there! 🌟\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', '🎄 RSS YEP 2025 Registration Form🎄', 'Admin', '2025-11-28 15:02:08', '[{\"original\":\"QRCode for \\ud83c\\udf84 RSS YEP 2025 Registration Form\\ud83c\\udf84.png\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_692948f0ccc985.35918963.png\"}]', 0),
(166, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nKindly check your attendance logs from November 16to 30, 2025 and file necessary adjustments. Please file them by 2:00PM today. Thank you!', 'Payroll Cutoff for Nov 16-30, 2025', 'Admin', '2025-12-01 10:13:03', NULL, 0),
(167, 'Hi Team, Happy Tuesday!\r\n\r\nJust a friendly reminder to please register through our RSS Year-End Party Registration Form. The registration cut-off is December 3, 2025 at 4 PM.\r\n\r\nThank you!', '🎄 RSS YEP 2025 Registration Form🎄', 'Admin', '2025-12-02 08:40:19', NULL, 0),
(168, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nWe’re happy to officially announce our Outreach Program happening on December 19, 2025 (Friday). We will be visiting Duyan ni Maria, a decades-old child-caring institution in the Philippines dedicated to supporting orphaned, abandoned, neglected, and economically disadvantaged children. The institution is located in Barangay Dapdap, Mabalacat City.\r\n\r\nIf you’d like to join this meaningful event, please register through the link below. Registration is open until December 12, 2025 (3 PM).\r\n\r\nLink: https://tinyurl.com/3b27asb7\r\n\r\nFor those who wish to donate, we will be placing a donation box in the pantry area. A QR code is also provided below for anyone who prefers to contribute a monetary donation.\r\n\r\nThank you, everyone, and please feel free to reach out to us directly if you have any questions.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'RSS Outreach Program 2025 Registration Form', 'Admin', '2025-12-04 09:08:16', '[{\"original\":\"Media (2).jpg\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_6930df003f7396.31932389.jpg\"}]', 0),
(169, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease be informed that salaries have been credited to your respective payroll accounts', 'Payroll: Nov 16-30, 2025', 'Admin', '2025-12-05 11:19:00', NULL, 0),
(170, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nHappy Monday!\r\n \r\nThe notification for our YEP this Friday has been sent to your clients. If you wish to file a half-day leave to prepare for the event, please coordinate with them directly.\r\n \r\nThank you! \r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'RSS YEP 2025', 'Admin', '2025-12-08 08:47:21', NULL, 0),
(171, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nMay we request the owner of the white Ford Territory with plate number NHL 2332 to kindly move their vehicle? Thank you.', 'Parking Notice', 'Admin', '2025-12-09 08:48:39', NULL, 0),
(172, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nThis is a friendly reminder that our payroll cut-off is tomorrow. Please ensure that all adjustments and overtime filings are submitted on or before 1:00 PM tomorrow, December 16, 2025 (Tuesday).\r\n\r\nKindly note that any late filings will be credited in the next payout.\r\n\r\nThank you for your cooperation.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'Payroll Cut Off', 'Admin', '2025-12-15 08:22:15', NULL, 0),
(173, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a Senior Accountant to join our growing team! This role involves end-to-end bookkeeping, taxation compliance support, cash flow modelling, and project platform administration. We’re looking for someone with strong attention to detail, technical accuracy, and the ability to work independently while collaborating closely with our client\'s Australia-based finance team.\r\n\r\n👥 Know someone who might be a great fit? Refer them to us and earn a PHP 10,000 referral bonus for every successful hire!\r\n\r\nRefer a friend today and enjoy an awesome referral bonus! 💸\r\n\r\nGot questions? Don’t hesitate to reach out, we’d be happy to help!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nRecruitment Team', 'Referral Alert! Earn a Bonus by Referring a Senior Accountant 🎯', 'Admin', '2025-12-17 09:37:37', NULL, 1),
(174, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a Senior Accountant to join our growing team! This role involves end-to-end bookkeeping, taxation compliance support, cash flow modelling, and project platform administration. We’re looking for someone with strong attention to detail, technical accuracy, and the ability to work independently while collaborating closely with our client\'s Australia-based finance team.\r\n\r\n👥 Know someone who might be a great fit? Refer them to us and earn a PHP 8,000.00 referral bonus for every successful hire!\r\n\r\nRefer a friend today and enjoy an awesome referral bonus! 💸\r\n\r\nGot questions? Don’t hesitate to reach out, we’d be happy to help!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nRecruitment Team', 'Referral Alert! Earn a Bonus by Referring a Senior Accountant 🎯', 'Admin', '2025-12-17 09:38:34', NULL, 0),
(175, 'Hi Everyone,\r\n\r\nAt around 1:47 PM today, December 18, 2025, we experienced a brief power outage. There was an approximately 30–40 second interval before the generator kicked in. Power was fully restored at around 1:53 PM.\r\n\r\nWe are currently checking with Berthaphil, as we did not receive any prior notification from them.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, we encourage everyone to regularly save their work to avoid any potential data loss.\r\n\r\nThank you, everyone.\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'Power Outage (December 18, 2025)', 'Admin', '2025-12-18 13:58:47', NULL, 0),
(176, 'Hi everyone,\r\n\r\nHappy Monday!\r\n\r\nDue to limited banking days, the cut-off for the January 5, 2026 payroll will be on December 31 at 11:00 AM.\r\n\r\nPlease ensure that all leaves, overtime (OT), VLs, and any changes to work schedules are filed in Harley on or before the cut-off. Any submissions received after this time will be credited in the next payout.\r\n\r\nThank you for your cooperation, and happy holidays!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'January 5, 2026 Payroll Cut-Off Notice', 'Admin', '2025-12-22 13:13:21', NULL, 0),
(177, 'Hey everyone! Please check out this video for the new Harley Employee Guide 2026 — it highlights all the key updates and shows the before-and-after changes you need to know.', 'Harley Employee Guide 2026', 'Admin', '2025-12-30 11:00:40', NULL, 1),
(178, 'test', 'test', 'Admin', '2025-12-30 11:05:59', NULL, 1),
(179, 'test', 'test', 'Admin', '2025-12-30 11:06:26', '[{\"original\":\"New Harley 2026 Employee Guide.mp4\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/Employee_Guide_2026.mp4\"}]', 1),
(180, 'Hey everyone! Please check out this video for the new Harley Employee Guide 2026 — it highlights all the key updates and shows the before-and-after changes you need to know.', 'Harley Employee Guide 2026', 'Admin', '2025-12-30 11:08:41', '[{\"original\":\"New Harley 2026 Employee Guide.mp4\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/Employee_Guide_2026.mp4\"}]', 0),
(181, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nAs we close another year, we would like to sincerely thank each and every one of you for your hard work, dedication, and commitment. Your efforts continue to make a real difference, and we truly appreciate everything you do.\r\n\r\nWe wish you and your loved ones a prosperous and joyful New Year. Here\'s to new opportunities, shared successes, and all the great things we will achieve together.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nRSS Internal Team', 'Happy New Year! 🎉', 'Admin', '2025-12-31 15:15:57', NULL, 0),
(182, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nResourcestaff is currently hiring for the following roles:\r\n\r\n👉 Business Development Representative (AU Based) – JD: https://lnkd.in/gqN9rnPq\r\n👉 Accountant – JD: https://lnkd.in/gdxrWJyt\r\n👉 Senior Electrical Estimator – JD: https://lnkd.in/gX73Jq6r\r\n👉 Sales Support – JD: https://lnkd.in/gP3S-bX5\r\n\r\nKnow someone who’s perfect for the role? Earn a referral bonus for every successful hire. Simply email your referral’s CV to rica.tolomia@resourcestaff.com.ph with the subject line: Referral for [Job Title].\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nRecruitment Team', '✨Referral Bonus Alert! ✨', 'Admin', '2026-01-02 11:14:52', NULL, 0),
(183, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nGood morning.\r\n\r\nPlease be advised that Quarterly Preventive Maintenance (PMS) for the elevator’s Automatic Voltage Regulator (AVR) will be conducted on Friday, January 30, 2026. Below is the schedule for Clark Center 10:\r\n\r\n• PE1: 1:00 PM – 2:00 PM\r\n• PE2: 2:00 PM – 3:00 PM\r\n\r\nKindly take the necessary steps to adjust your operations accordingly during the scheduled maintenance period. Please note that the elevators will not be operational for approximately one (1) hour during the PMS.\r\n\r\nThank you for your cooperation.', 'Notice: Quarterly Preventive Maintenance – Elevator AVR', 'Admin', '2026-01-13 07:44:34', NULL, 0),
(184, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nHappy Monday.\r\n\r\nWe would like to inform you that our IT Specialist, Cedrick Arnigo, is no longer with RSS. Cedrick has been a pleasure to work with, and while we are saddened by his decision to leave the company, we respect his choice to explore opportunities outside of RSS.\r\n\r\nPlease be assured that his departure will not affect ongoing operations. We continue to have IT partners in place who will address and support any IT-related concerns.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, kindly direct any IT-related inquiries or concerns to the following email addresses:\r\n\r\n- Rica.tolomia@resourcestaff.com.ph\r\n- Tina.pangan@resourcestaff.com.ph\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nHR Department', 'IT Support Update', 'Admin', '2026-01-19 08:14:19', NULL, 1),
(185, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nHappy Monday.\r\n\r\nWe would like to inform you that our IT Specialist, Cedrick Arnigo, is no longer with RSS. Cedrick has been a pleasure to work with, and while we are saddened by his decision to leave the company, we respect his choice to explore opportunities outside of RSS.\r\n\r\nPlease be assured that his departure will not affect ongoing operations. We continue to have IT partners in place who will address and support any IT-related concerns.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, kindly direct any IT-related inquiries or concerns to the following email addresses:\r\n\r\n- IT@resourcestaff.com.ph\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nHR Department', 'IT Support Update', 'Admin', '2026-01-19 08:16:25', NULL, 0),
(186, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nOur updated schedule for today’s event is here!\r\n\r\nWe can’t wait to see everyone later. Bring the energy, bring the excitement, and most importantly… wear your colors proudly! ❤️🩷🧡💛💚💙🩵💜🩶🖤', 'February 13, 2026: Valentine\'s Event', 'Admin', '2026-02-13 07:14:51', '[{\"original\":\"wear your status (1).png\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_698e5eebe825b7.90335584.png\"},{\"original\":\"wear your status (2).png\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_698e5eebe88fd0.35904514.png\"}]', 1),
(187, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease revisit your attendance history for this payroll. Kindly note that any late filing of OTs, time adjustments, and leaves will be credited next cutoff. Submit any disputes for this payroll until 7AM tomorrow, Feb 17, 2026.', 'Payroll Feb 01 - 15, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-02-16 14:01:00', NULL, 0),
(188, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nMSN. :))\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'Payroll Feb 01 - 15, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-02-20 13:53:59', NULL, 0),
(189, 'We’re excited to announce that HDesk is launching soon as RSS’s official ticketing system, a smarter, faster, and more efficient way to address your concerns and inquiries.\r\n\r\nGet ready for a smoother support experience and stay tuned for more updates. In the meantime, don’t miss our teaser video and see what’s coming next!', 'Ticketing System on the Way! 🎉', 'Admin', '2026-02-22 16:01:50', '[{\"original\":\"Hdesk_revise.mp4\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_699ab7ede941b4.87825833.mp4\"}]', 0),
(190, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease revisit your attendance history for this payroll. Kindly note that any late filing of OTs, time adjustments, and leaves will be credited next cutoff. Submit any disputes for this payroll until 2PM today, March 02, 2026.', 'Payroll Feb 16 - 28, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-03-02 09:23:02', NULL, 0),
(191, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nMSN. :))\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'Payroll Feb 16 - 28, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-03-05 12:21:12', NULL, 0),
(192, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nHappy Friday!\r\n\r\nStarting February 1, all LOA requests to our HMO must be submitted through their Virtual App.\r\n\r\nPlease refer to the video below for the step-by-step tutorial on how to create a Virtual App account and how to submit your LOA request.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reach out.\r\n\r\nThank you!', 'Announcement: New Process for LOA Requests via Virtual App', 'Admin', '2026-03-13 15:13:53', '[{\"original\":\"Cocolife Virtual App Registration Video.mp4\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69b3b9316ee214.99145441.mp4\"}]', 0),
(193, 'Hi All!\r\n\r\nOur most awaited Ticketing System is finally here! 🎉\r\n\r\nTo help you get started with HDesk and make the most out of its features, please watch our quick video tutorial.\r\nThis will guide you on how to properly submit and track your requests through the ticketing system.', 'Getting Started with HDesk: Your New Ticketing System', 'Admin', '2026-03-13 16:17:14', '[{\"original\":\"hdesk_guide.mp4\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69b3c80a6488a3.43801915.mp4\"}]', 0),
(194, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease revisit your attendance history for this payroll. Kindly note that any late filing of OTs, time adjustments, and leaves will be credited next cutoff. Submit any disputes for this payroll until 2PM today, March 16, 2026.', 'Payroll Feb 01 - 15, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-03-16 08:14:00', NULL, 1),
(195, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease revisit your attendance history for this payroll. Kindly note that any late filing of OTs, time adjustments, and leaves will be credited next cutoff. Submit any disputes for this payroll until 2PM today, March 16, 2026.', 'Payroll March 01 - 15, 2026', 'Admin', '2026-03-16 08:14:25', NULL, 0),
(196, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nHappy Monday!\r\n\r\nOn March 12, 2026, the Office of the President announced that March 20, 2026 (Friday) will be observed as a public holiday.\r\n\r\nUpon checking our holiday swapping calendar, only the following states will observe this holiday as it is listed as an unmatched holiday: VIC, NSW, and QLD.\r\n\r\nAn advisory has already been sent to your respective clients. Please note that if you will be working on Friday, we will require approval from your client. If your client allows you to take the holiday off, there is no need to inform HR.\r\n\r\nFor the remaining states (WA and SA), March 20 will be treated as a normal working day since this date has been matched with the April 6, 2026 holiday in the holiday swapping calendar.\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR', 'HR Advisory: Public Holiday - March 20, 2026 (Friday)', 'Admin', '2026-03-16 09:21:28', '[{\"original\":\"Holiday Proclamation.pdf\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69b75b1823dee8.64923663.pdf\"}]', 0),
(197, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nThis is to inform everyone that we will be conducting our annual fire and earthquake drill on Tuesday, March 24, 2026, from 2:00 PM to 3:00 PM (PH Time). A notification has already been sent to our clients.\r\n\r\nPlease note that only onsite and hybrid team members are required to attend the drill. Team members working remotely or at Aeropark do not need to come to the office.\r\n\r\nThank you for your cooperation.\r\n\r\nRegards,\r\nHR Department', 'Annual Fire & Earthquake Drill - March 24, 2026 (Tuesday)', 'Admin', '2026-03-20 09:44:40', NULL, 0),
(198, 'Hi Everyone,\r\n\r\nDue to the holidays this April and the limited banking days, our cutoff for the April 5 payout will be earlier than usual.\r\n\r\nAll OTs, leaves, schedule changes, and time adjustments must be filed by March 31, 2026, at 1:00 PM. Any submissions after this deadline will be processed in the next payout.\r\n\r\nPlease ensure strict compliance.\r\n\r\nThank you!', 'HR Advisory: Payroll Cut-off for April 5, 2026 Payout', 'Admin', '2026-03-25 07:23:59', NULL, 0),
(199, 'Hi Team,\r\n\r\nWe’re happy to announce that Executive Optical will be visiting our office this Thursday for an engagement activity.\r\n\r\nThey will be offering free eye check-ups and will also bring a selection of frames and contact lenses for those who wish to avail of their products. As part of our renewed partnership with EO, purchases made during the event will be discounted and can be paid via salary deduction in four staggered payments.\r\n\r\nThe program will start at 11:00 AM with a wellness talk, followed by the eye check-ups and product availability for interested employees. Food and drinks will also be provided.\r\n\r\nThank you, and we hope to see you there!\r\n\r\nCheers,\r\nHR Department', 'Engagement Thursday', 'Admin', '2026-03-25 11:56:10', NULL, 0),
(200, 'Wishing a big happy birthday to RJ, our HR & Talent Specialist!\r\n\r\nThank you for all the work you put into supporting the team, from recruitment to keeping things running smoothly behind the scenes. We know a lot of what you do doesn’t always get seen, but it definitely makes a big difference.\r\n\r\nAppreciate your consistency, reliability, and the way you support both the team and our clients.\r\n\r\nHope you have a great birthday today and get to enjoy it (with good food, of course 😄). Cheers to another year ahead! 🎂✨', '🎉 Happy Birthday, RJ! 🎉', 'Admin', '2026-04-01 07:50:14', '[{\"original\":\"White and Pink Happy Birthday Facebook Post.png\",\"stored\":\"uploads\\/file_69cc5db6645e84.43235024.png\"}]', 0),
(201, 'Hi All,\r\n\r\nPlease submit your payroll disputes on or before 12:00 noon today. Any disputes filed after 12:00 noon will still be recorded but will be credited in the next payroll cycle.\r\n\r\nThank you.', 'HR Advisory: Payroll Cut-off for April 5, 2026 Payout', 'Admin', '2026-04-01 10:48:50', NULL, 0);
